{"channelId":"UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","row":["4 Gus",639,"I volunteer at animal shelters in Cyprus and share the sad and happy stories of these poor animals. Join me at the shelter as I give some love to the animals in need. There is a huge problem here in Cyprus with abandoned, abused, and neglected animals. These shelters work to save these animals and to find them their forever homes in nearby countries. I hope to spread the word that adoption is a rewarding choice. \n\nSome rescue groups I love:\n\nTAKIS SHELTER - A wonderful man in Crete, dedicates his life to rescuing and running a large non-profit shelter. He offers short stay live-in volunteer opportunities if you want to combine a vacation with giving.\n\nARC - Animal Rescue Corps in Tennessee, called in situations such as puppy mill raids, hoarding, and police involved cruelty cases. Volunteer opportunities.\n\nHOPE FOR PAWS - An angel in California who dedicates his life to rescuing.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:27.497Z","channelId":"UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7d0193a248837e79aa148162d16ef2ff6905a8c8448d951b76aeeb04e6a9c039","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e9b4317c6374c4062bb29895026fabc69cd5386f1bb90e3790d2394863b8401c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:27.497Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":639,"raw":"639 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbGMVanyhuvbHn9b2YjNfcA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:27.497Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keywo